# Copy this file to `.env` (for local dev) and fill in your own Helius API
# key. Get one free at https://www.helius.dev
#
# Netlify deploys do NOT read this file — set VITE_HELIUS_API_KEY in your
# Netlify site's Environment variables (Site configuration -> Environment
# variables) instead, so it's available when Netlify runs `npm run build`.
#
# NOTE: because this is a VITE_-prefixed variable, Vite inlines its value
# into the client-side JS bundle at build time — it IS visible to anyone
# who inspects the deployed site. Use a key you're comfortable being
# public-facing, and consider restricting it to your site's domain(s) in
# the Helius dashboard.
VITE_HELIUS_API_KEY=your_helius_api_key_here
